[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: The renderer: a content-blind page over one payload, keyed on tree shape and widget words

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @repo

[MECHANISM]
UID: MECH-VIEW-RENDERER
TITLE: The renderer: a content-blind page over one payload, keyed on tree shape and widget words
DEPTH: implemented
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
render.py takes one payload and one template and writes one self-contained
page; it refuses any payload whose schema it was not built for. The page's
structure is what the narratives declare: the top strip is the canon root's
tab children, then every other root as a tab, then Nodes; a root's own
screen is its Start -- its body, its section and card children stacked,
what it cites, then the check findings under it; a tab's screen is the same
over the tab; a screen child has a screen of its own with previous and next
over its siblings and a crumb to its container, and a container that
declares no index of its own lists its screen children. Each narrative
draws its STATEMENT as its WIDGET names, over the subject its Over relation
names, else itself; one whose TAGS names a grammar element draws that
element's fields, roles and ladders with live counts beside it; one whose
TAGS names a query word draws the table the wireline computed for it. The
Nodes tab lists every node of the selection grouped by type with its state
and facets, and gives each node a screen with its fields, its relations,
its fingerprints and the rows that link it; the rows that link a
narrative's screen draw beneath it the same way. Every UID is shown with
its title; colour is only ever a legend word and is always written out
beside it; the system switches select client-side and ride in the address.
The page renders in both themes.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The screens are an opinion about shape, allowed by REQ-VIEW-RENDERER-IS-CONTENT-BLIND; a project whose root has no legend simply has no colours.
<<<
PARENT_FP: >>>
DEC-NARRATIVE-DECLARES-ITS-PLACE:0000000
DEC-WIDGET-SUBJECT-IS-ITS-OVER-TARGET:0000000
<<<
NOTES: >>>
Rewritten 2026-08-30 to the PLACE model. The earlier statement described a structure derived from tree depth (one tab per child of the root, sections under a tab, cards under a section), which DEC-NARRATIVE-DECLARES-ITS-PLACE retired the same day.
<<<
